            "source:21ab869e61e008e6f3b14331",
            "source:6dcf71624afbcd22241b850f",
            "source:5c130cfd01d3faea74b69a7c",
            "source:5b86a3db2c574b5ad7dad542"
          ],
          "text": "A Wrathfin fighter who boasts that its blood is venom and calls opponents “warmbloods.” It invokes the depths of Nazjatar and attacks with Coral Cut.",
          "when": {
