      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 17771,
      "name": "Murkblood Oracle",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:17771:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:7933512a6be7b5ecbf3221d1",
            "source:f7941c5a20632212a55699f1",
            "source:ac672616e3a700858bda67a0"
          ],
          "text": "The Murkblood Oracle is one of several Oracles in the Underbog. Outside combat, it casts Elemental Armor.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 17771
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 17826,
      "name": "Swamplord Musel'ek",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:17826:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:f4af404895ef1d9656b3f61e",
            "source:a5f171b6da05cf6601b808c8",
            "source:6272bc2b2ea21c9d7a883233",
            "source:70769cd50bb24fec0edd5720",
            "source:2d651c32e669c313823728d4",
            "source:8d61f12ca159d10c62b7619f",
            "source:26ec6a08c42c225d7144f5b3"
          ],
          "text": "Swamplord Musel'ek is a fighter who commands a beast to kill his opponents and declares that they will fight to the death. He threatens to end the battle quickly, then marks a kill as finished. Claw is held as Musel'ek's pet; if freed, Claw plans to seek out Rayge.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 17826
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 17827,
      "name": "Claw",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:17827:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:8d61f12ca159d10c62b7619f",
            "source:52d81b45c75e30d14fac5760",
            "source:26ec6a08c42c225d7144f5b3",
            "source:e7f8ca7e3b4b0d0a805228a3",
            "source:0a432be90fc8c47c5eefcd23"
          ],
          "text": "Claw resents having been kept as Musel'ek's pet. He thanks the person who freed him, says he can find his own way out, and may look for Rayge along the way. In combat, he charges and uses an echoing roar.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 17827
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "Swamplord Musel'ek's Pet"
    },
    {
      "entry": 17871,
      "name": "Underbog Shambler",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:17871:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:873fbe6f707f603e11857a6a",
            "source:09d52d3dac4e953fb43925fa",
            "source:d6d3ccb334c47dd67c2e8af2",
            "source:776cb502c89a168b2e658556",
            "source:c43fc7c77b02392e740a11bd"
          ],
          "text": "Underbog Shambler is a hostile creature found in the Underbog. In combat, it uses Itchy Spores and Allergies, and it can recover with Fungal Regrowth.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 17871
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 17882,
      "name": "The Black Stalker",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:17882:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
